So I'm going to have
to learn how to drive.

00:07:32.819 --> 00:07:35.154 align:start size:97% position:3%
I am, I am shocked--
- That's a true New Yorker.

00:07:35.154 --> 00:07:36.522
That's a true New Yorker.

00:07:36.522 --> 00:07:38.124 align:start size:81% position:19%
- This is what
I'm shocked about,

00:07:38.124 --> 00:07:42.361 align:start size:84% position:16%
I am shocked to
