- Yeah, I love it I love it.

00:19:15.354 --> 00:19:17.222 align:start size:97% position:3%
- In a second, like he
made the point, he's a dad.

00:19:17.222 --> 00:19:19.224 align:start size:81% position:19%
He's got, I think,
five daughters.

00:19:19.224 --> 00:19:21.627
