consequences.

00:19:31.503 --> 00:19:34.306 align:start position:0% line:0%
You know, a lot of times people
who are a holier than thou,

00:19:34.306 --> 00:19:35.674 align:start size:84% position:16%
smarter than everybody
else, you know,

00:19:35.674 --> 00:19:38.510
urban elites make fun
of religious people.

00:19:38.510 --> 00:19:40.779
But when you're four
or five years old,

00:19:40.779 --> 00:19:42.314
