to think that there are

00:19:42.314 --> 00:19:45.751 align:start size:94% position:6%
these invisible demons
everywhere they go outside

00:19:45.751 --> 00:19:48.020 align:start size:88% position:13%
and without this
magical piece of fabric

00:19:48.020 --> 00:19:49.521
in front of your face,

00:19:49.521 --> 00:19:51.557
you're one day away from
killing your grandparents.

00:19:51.557 --> 00:19:54.927
This is not a healthy,
psychological message

00:19:54.927 --> 00:19:57.396
to tell children, that
you should be afraid

00:19:57.396 --> 00:19:59.498
of leaving the house.

00:19:59.498 --> 00:20:01.300 align:start size:88% position:13%
- What about how they've
butchered science?

00:20:01.300 --> 00:20:02.568
I mean, there's almost nothing--

00:20:02.568 --> 00:20:05.204
Even, even me, I mean,
I'm fairly well-read.

00:20:05.204 --> 00:20:06.972
I talked to some
interesting people.

00:20:06.972 --> 00:20:08.907 align:start size:84% position:16%
I'm pretty much
completely skeptical

00:20:08.907 --> 00:20:10.776 align:start size:88% position:13%
of anyone that says
anything about science.

00:20:10.776 --> 00:20:12.277 align:start size:84% position:16%
You say the word
science and I'm like,

00:20:12.277 --> 00:20:13.212
