00:20:13.212 --> 00:20:14.446
I mean, that Faucian effect,

00:20:14.446 --> 00:20:16.915
has destroyed the
complete ability

00:20:16.915 --> 00:20:18.584 align:start position:0%
for anyone to believe anything,
at least in my opinion.

00:20:18.584 --> 00:20:20.519
- Well, I mean, it's
even broader than that

00:20:20.519 --> 00:20:21.820
because we're being
told every five years

00:20:21.820 --> 00:20:24.022
