00:21:14.673 --> 00:21:17.109 align:start size:97% position:3%
You guys handed over all
your authority to the state,

00:21:17.109 --> 00:21:18.277
to Washington.

00:21:18.277 --> 00:21:20.579 align:start size:88% position:13%
This is a bigger crisis
than the Great War

00:21:20.579 --> 00:21:22.080
and that's actually true.

00:21:22.080 --> 00:21:24.149
Like in terms of which is
a bigger threat to America,

00:21:24.149 --> 00:21:26.318
the Great Depression or the hun?

00:21:26.318 --> 00:21:28.854
It was certainly the,
the Great Depression.

00:21:28.854 --> 00:21:31.423 align:start size:97% position:3%
And, you know, I tweeted
this out, I think a year ago,

00:21:31.423 --> 00:21:34.626 align:start size:88% position:13%
some very, like it or
not, wrongly or rightly,

00:21:34.626 --> 00:21:38.497
whatever the science is,
some very, very bad people

