00:25:33.765 --> 00:25:36.001 align:start size:84% position:16%
It's more like it's
the right thing to do.

00:25:36.001 --> 00:25:37.469
Don't ask any questions.

00:25:37.469 --> 00:25:39.571
And like, if something
