- Oh yeah.

00:54:58.528 --> 00:55:01.431
Like close family members
that won't talk to me.

00:55:01.431 --> 00:55:05.101 align:start size:97% position:3%
Like, you know, the, just
the endless, the crazy types.

00:55:05.101 --> 00:55:06.636
