together over the years

00:55:16.146 --> 00:55:18.515
we always did this, this
thing that we're doing

00:55:18.515 --> 00:55:20.684 align:start size:88% position:13%
we always did this
about everything, right.

00:55:20.684 --> 00:55:21.618
I meet him at a bar.

00:55:21.618 --> 00:55:22.752
It was obvious that our politics

00:55:22.752 --> 00:55:23.987 align:start size:84% position:16%
