which I wanted to talk about.

00:55:32.162 --> 00:55:33.963
I didn't want to do politics.

00:55:33.963 --> 00:55:36.666 align:start size:97% position:3%
He's just attacking me over
and over and over again

00:55:36.666 --> 00:55:38.568 align:start size:81% position:19%
