to him, I said,

00:55:38.568 --> 00:55:42.238
"Do you think it's possible
that I believe what I believe

00:55:42.238 --> 00:55:44.607 align:start size:88% position:13%
"as much as you believe
what you believe?"

00:55:44.607 --> 00:55:48.378 align:start size:88% position:13%
and without hesitation,
he said, "No."

00:55:48.378 --> 00:55:52.215
And I thought that level
of certitude is something

00:55:52.215 --> 00:55:53.683
that I want nothing to do with.

00:55:53.683 --> 00:55:56.019
- But also the sense
that you can imagine

00:55:56.019 --> 00:55:58.555
someone saying this and
then as soon as the words

00:55:58.555 --> 00:56:00.190
come out of their mouth
