00:56:00.190 --> 00:56:02.192
like if I'm making fun of
somebody I'll go too far

00:56:02.192 --> 00:56:03.693 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I hear it and I'm
like whoa, I'm sorry Dave.

00:56:03.693 --> 00:56:04.961
I didn't..

00:56:04.961 --> 00:56:06.663
- I didn't mean it
that way, but no!

00:56:06.663 --> 00:56:07.797 align:start size:84% position:16%
- And you would
catch yourself, like,

00:56:07.797 --> 00:56:09.299
