on September 10th, 2001

00:56:56.479 --> 00:56:58.915 align:start size:84% position:16%
and coming out as
being right of center,

00:56:58.915 --> 00:57:01.184
because you're also in very
different parts of your life.

00:57:01.184 --> 00:57:02.485 align:start size:88% position:13%
You know, you're
younger here, you know,

00:57:02.485 --> 00:57:04.087
you don't have the
financial stability.

00:57:04.087 --> 00:57:06.256
You don't have the
