00:57:06.256 --> 00:57:07.724
Here you're older.

00:57:07.724 --> 00:57:08.992 align:start size:84% position:16%
- This was a million
times harder.

00:57:08.992 --> 00:57:10.059
It's not even close.

00:57:10.059 --> 00:57:10.994
It's not even close.

00:57:10.994 --> 00:57:11.928
Politically, I'm talking about

00:57:11.928 --> 00:57:13.730
rather than coming out as gay.

00:57:13.730 --> 00:57:16.933
I was 25 then yes, I
