00:57:16.933 --> 00:57:18.668 align:start size:88% position:13%
Some which, by the
way, the ghosts of that

00:57:18.668 --> 00:57:19.936
live with me at 44.

00:57:19.936 --> 00:57:22.038
Like, that's just how life is.

00:57:22.038 --> 00:57:23.573 align:start size:81% position:19%
But it was like
an internal thing.

00:57:23.573 --> 00:57:25.308 align:start size:97% position:3%
And by the way, when I
