00:57:25.308 --> 00:57:26.743
everybody reacted great.

00:57:26.743 --> 00:57:28.411
There were one or two
little family things.

00:57:28.411 --> 00:57:29.746
One or two, people were shocked.

00:57:29.746 --> 00:57:31.247
I don't, I don't act gay,

00:57:31.247 --> 00:57:32.882 align:start size:97% position:3%
