00:57:44.627 --> 00:57:47.130 align:start size:88% position:13%
and great be who you
are and like, fantastic,

00:57:47.130 --> 00:57:48.665
this is amazing and wonderful.

00:57:48.665 --> 00:57:53.303
This thing of doing this,
it's an endless reckoning,

00:57:53.303 --> 00:57:55.672
where David now gets
messages on Facebook,

00:57:55.672 --> 00:57:57.507
