00:58:59.269 --> 00:59:01.571
or looking for peers
who like you as you.

00:59:01.571 --> 00:59:03.373
It's gonna be tough
in the medium term.

00:59:03.373 --> 00:59:04.941
It's gonna be very tough,

00:59:04.941 --> 00:59:06.442
than to be trapped in a cage,

00:59:06.442 --> 00:59:08.278
where you're fed like a
little tablet every day

00:59:08.278 --> 00:59:10.446 align:start size:84% position:16%
or trapped in a social
group where you,

00:59:10.446 --> 00:59:12.982
