shoulders back?

00:59:56.259 --> 00:59:57.794 align:start size:84% position:16%
Somebody said that,
who said that?

00:59:57.794 --> 00:59:58.962
Wasn't there some guy that
was saying that for while?

00:59:58.962 --> 01:00:00.930 align:start size:84% position:16%
- Well, not everybody,
people are weak.

01:00:00.930 --> 01:00:02.699
So they, you know,
like I said earlier,

01:00:02.699 --> 01:00:04.667 align:start size:84% position:16%
they'd rather be
safe than to be free.

01:00:04.667 --> 01:00:06.135
But for the most people,

01:00:06.135 --> 01:00:08.905 align:start size:88% position:13%
the people that I would
like listen to me.

01:00:08.905 --> 01:00:12.275
- What about the general idea
that on this side of things,

01:00:12.275 --> 01:00:14.911
again, you wrote the book, it
was called, "The New Right".

01:00:14.911 --> 01:00:16.145
I'm on the back of the book,

01:00:16.145 --> 01:00:18.047
called you the Willy
Wonka of politics.

01:00:18.047 --> 01:00:19.782
One of your greatest
accolades, I think.

01:00:19.782 --> 01:00:21.150
- I love that!

01:00:21.150 --> 01:00:23.753 align:start size:88% position:13%
Can I tell you one thing
in all seriousness?

01:00:23.753 --> 01:00:25.788 align:start size:84% position:16%
Harvey Pekar, the
late comic book writer

01:00:25.788 --> 01:00:27.290
of "American Splendor" fame,

01:00:27.290 --> 01:00:29.192
he wrote a book about me
called "Ego and Hubris"

01:00:29.192 --> 01:00:30.493
that came out in 2006.

01:00:30.493 --> 01:00:31.995
It goes for $300 on eBay now.

01:00:31.995 --> 01:00:33.763
- I've seen the
pictures on eBay.

01:00:35.164 --> 01:00:37.233 align:start size:97% position:3%
- When I watch "Charlie
and the Chocolate Factory",

01:00:37.233 --> 01:00:39.469 align:start size:88% position:13%
the Johnny Depp version,
which is superior,

01:00:39.469 --> 01:00:42.205
I do cry a little bit
and I'm not kidding,

01:00:42.205 --> 01:00:45.041 align:start size:84% position:16%
because Harvey gave
me that golden ticket.

01:00:45.041 --> 01:00:48.344 line:0%
Harvey's the one who saw
something special in me,

01:00:48.344 --> 01:00:53.282 align:start size:97% position:3% line:0%
who saw someone unique and
put his reputation on the line

01:00:53.282 --> 01:00:55.885 align:start size:97% position:3%
and said, I'm going to write
a book about this freak

01:00:55.885 --> 01:00:59.656 align:start size:97% position:3%
and that was such a major step
in me becoming independent.

01:00:59.656 --> 01:01:04.193
So if you're not, if you
are that special person

01:01:04.193 --> 01:01:05.828
and people don't like special,

01:01:05.828 --> 01:01:07.196 align:start size:84% position:16%
they want everything
to be the same.

01:01:07.196 --> 01:01:08.731
They want to watch
"Big Bang Theory".

01:01:08.731 --> 01:01:12.201 align:start size:84% position:16%
They want to watch,
you know, Chris Cuomo.

01:01:12.201 --> 01:01:13.803
When you're an outlier,

01:01:13.803 --> 01:01:16.205
people aren't trained
on how to handle you.

01:01:16.205 --> 01:01:18.107
Some people be drawn to you.

01:01:18.107 --> 01:01:20.309 align:start size:81% position:19%
A majority will
be put off by you.

01:01:20.309 --> 01:01:23.613 align:start size:84% position:16%
But when you meet
your maker, I promise,

01:01:23.613 --> 01:01:25.615 align:start size:88% position:13%
you are going to be
able to, like you said,

01:01:25.615 --> 01:01:27.417
hold your head up high

01:01:27.417 --> 01:01:31.521 align:start size:94% position:6%
because you lived
according to your values.

01:01:31.521 --> 01:01:34.223
- So Jordan been, since I
just mentioned Jordan that,

01:01:34.223 --> 01:01:35.458
what you just said right there,

01:01:35.458 --> 01:01:37.026 align:start size:88% position:13%
did you happen to see
the clip that went viral

01:01:37.026 --> 01:01:39.228 align:start size:84% position:16%
of Jordan in the
last couple of weeks,

01:01:39.228 --> 01:01:41.731
where he was on Tucker
Carlson's Fox Nation Show

01:01:41.731 --> 01:01:43.933 align:start size:97% position:3%
and he's talking about telling
the truth for truth sake.

01:01:43.933 --> 01:01:44.967
Did you happen to see
this by any chance?

01:01:44.967 --> 01:01:46.269
- I have not.

01:01:46.269 --> 01:01:47.804
- So we're going to lay
the clip in right here.

01:01:47.804 --> 01:01:50.073
- You know, you, you, you
make your decisions in life

01:01:50.073 --> 01:01:53.609
and I decided when I was
very young, in my mid 20s,

01:01:53.609 --> 01:01:55.244
that I was going to
say what I believed

01:01:55.244 --> 01:01:56.813
and see what happened.

01:01:56.813 --> 01:01:59.148
I talked to you earlier in
the talk about adventure,

01:01:59.148 --> 01:02:01.718
you know, about the
adventure of truth

01:02:03.119 --> 01:02:05.388 align:start size:97% position:3%
and I don't think I'm happy
about what has happened

01:02:05.388 --> 01:02:07.423 align:start size:84% position:16%
and I certainly have
dragged my family

01:02:07.423 --> 01:02:10.560 align:start size:88% position:13%
through their fair
share of well, both hell

01:02:10.560 --> 01:02:13.229 align:start size:94% position:6%
and also incomprehensible
opportunity.

01:02:14.397 --> 01:02:16.099 align:start size:88% position:13%
It's expanded their
lives in both directions

01:02:16.099 --> 01:02:17.700
to a tremendous degree,

01:02:17.700 --> 01:02:20.103
but it's certainly
been an adventure.

01:02:20.103 --> 01:02:22.038
It's not being dull.

01:02:22.038 --> 01:02:24.207
And I don't believe that it,

01:02:24.207 --> 01:02:26.109 align:start size:84% position:16%
I don't believe that
it was a mistake.

01:02:26.109 --> 01:02:28.745 align:start position:0%
Whatever happens as a
consequence of telling the truth

01:02:28.745 --> 01:02:31.047
is the best thing
that can happen.

01:02:32.482 --> 01:02:34.317
It doesn't really matter how
it looks to you at the moment

01:02:34.317 --> 01:02:36.285
or maybe even across the years,

01:02:36.285 --> 01:02:37.553
'cause you have to,

01:02:37.553 --> 01:02:39.188
it's a, it's a, it's a,
it's an article of faith

01:02:39.188 --> 01:02:40.623
in some sense.

01:02:40.623 --> 01:02:43.059 align:start size:97% position:3%
Do you believe that reality
is better constituted

01:02:43.059 --> 01:02:46.195
as a consequence of
truth or falsity?

01:02:46.195 --> 01:02:49.165 align:start size:97% position:3%
If you believe that
reality is best constituted

01:02:49.165 --> 01:02:51.267
as a consequence of truth,

01:02:51.267 --> 01:02:54.070 align:start size:97% position:3%
then you have a responsibility
to speak the truth

01:02:54.070 --> 01:02:57.740 align:start size:88% position:13%
and you can't assess the
consequences and say,

01:02:57.740 --> 01:03:00.943 align:start size:97% position:3%
well that was a mistake
because part of the decision

01:03:00.943 --> 01:03:04.280 align:start size:97% position:3%
that reality is best
constituted as a consequence

01:03:04.280 --> 01:03:06.149 align:start size:88% position:13%
of the truth is the
decision that no matter

01:03:06.149 --> 01:03:07.784
what happens is the best

01:03:07.784 --> 01:03:10.553
if it's a consequence
of telling the truth.

01:03:10.553 --> 01:03:12.688
And so that's what I conclude.

01:03:12.688 --> 01:03:14.724
It's like, this is what happened

01:03:14.724 --> 01:03:17.460
because I said what I
had to say as clearly

01:03:17.460 --> 01:03:21.964 align:start size:97% position:3%
as I could say it, and that's
as good as it could be.

01:03:21.964 --> 01:03:23.699
Now, whether or not that's good,

01:03:23.699 --> 01:03:26.602
well it's good compared to
all possible alternatives,

01:03:26.602 --> 01:03:29.038 align:start size:84% position:16%
all possible realistic
alternatives.

01:03:29.038 --> 01:03:31.240
That's an article of faith
as far as I'm concerned.

01:03:31.240 --> 01:03:34.577
You know, our culture is
predicated on the idea

01:03:34.577 --> 01:03:39.448
that truth in speech is
of divine significance.

01:03:39.448 --> 01:03:42.585 align:start size:97% position:3%
It's the fundamental
presupposition of our culture.

01:03:43.753 --> 01:03:44.587
Well,

01:03:46.422 --> 01:03:49.158
