- Oh yeah, I like that.

01:12:59.241 --> 01:13:00.509
I'm going to pretend
I thought of that.

01:13:00.509 --> 01:13:03.579
So the fact that I
have so many people

01:13:03.579 --> 01:13:05.714
who are willing to toss
me five bucks a month

01:13:05.714 --> 01:13:08.117
for nothing in return, I'm
still going to do the work

01:13:08.117 --> 01:13:10.753 align:start size:88% position:13%
because they're like
you are taking the fight

01:13:10.753 --> 01:13:13.188
that I as a business
owner, or a, you know,

01:13:13.188 --> 01:13:16.091 align:start size:88% position:13%
a young professional
aren't a position to do,

01:13:16.091 --> 01:13:19.395 align:start size:88% position:13%
that is very, very
humbling and flattering

01:13:19.395 --> 01:13:21.330
and I could not
be more grateful.

01:13:21.330 --> 01:13:24.233 align:start size:88% position:13%
And it also means I
don't have to be afraid

01:13:24.233 --> 01:13:27.369 align:start size:84% position:16%
because if I had a
situation with Locals,

01:13:27.369 --> 01:13:28.937
I'd get on the phone with you,

01:13:28.937 --> 01:13:31.807 align:start size:97% position:3%
we would hash it out and
we'd come to some conclusion,

01:13:31.807 --> 01:13:33.709
even if we have to
go our separate ways.

01:13:33.709 --> 01:13:36.512 align:start size:84% position:16%
But I know I'm never
going to wake up

01:13:36.512 --> 01:13:38.514
and have the community vanished

01:13:38.514 --> 01:13:40.582 align:start size:97% position:3%
and have no explanation other
than some press release.

01:13:40.582 --> 01:13:41.817
- Be very clear, Michael,

01:13:41.817 --> 01:13:43.018
you're not getting
on the phone with me

01:13:43.018 --> 01:13:44.219
'cause that's not what I do

01:13:44.219 --> 01:13:45.421 align:start size:88% position:13%
but you'd get on the
phone with someone there

01:13:45.421 --> 01:13:46.955
and guess what?

01:13:46.955 --> 01:13:48.424
It's your community, you do
whatever the hell you want.

01:13:48.424 --> 01:13:49.625
If you're breaking the
laws of the United States

01:13:49.625 --> 01:13:50.559 align:start size:84% position:16%
you've got bigger
problems than Locals.

01:13:50.559 --> 01:13:52.628
- You're taking my call, Rubin.

01:13:52.628 --> 01:13:53.996 align:start size:84% position:16%
- I'll take your
call anyway, but not,

01:13:53.996 --> 01:13:55.864
not about this sort of stuff.

01:13:55.864 --> 01:13:58.467
You know, Malice, I didn't
know what I was walking into.

01:13:58.467 --> 01:14:00.903 align:start size:97% position:3%
You said to me that, you
know, I should sit here first

01:14:00.903 --> 01:14:01.737
before seeing you.

01:14:01.737 --> 01:14:03.172
My guys got to see you.

01:14:03.172 --> 01:14:04.840 align:start size:97% position:3%
I honestly thought you
were going to be dressed up

01:14:04.840 --> 01:14:06.341
as Bea Arthur from
the "Golden Girls".

01:14:06.341 --> 01:14:09.144
That was my, it was
just my gut feeling,

01:14:09.144 --> 01:14:11.780 align:start size:88% position:13%
but you've you've
surprised me yet again.

01:14:11.780 --> 01:14:14.817 align:start size:88% position:13%
And thus, you are the
Willy Wonka of politics.

01:14:14.817 --> 01:14:17.586 align:start size:88% position:13%
- Well, thank you
Veruca, I appreciate it.

01:14:17.586 --> 01:14:18.821
- Can you see my hand?

01:14:18.821 --> 01:14:19.655
- I cannot.

01:14:22.057 --> 01:14:23.258
Is it the finger?

